        "Write the condition that holds for a number greater than zero, and the text that goes with it. Then the condition for a number below zero, and the text for it.",
        "The last branch of the chain has no condition of its own. It is the answer for every number the earlier branches did not take, which is exactly what zero needs.",
        "Run dune runtest test/control-flow again and read the checks. If the build failed, the compiler is telling you the type of the body is not the type the signature promises.",
        "The body of sign_of is a chain of three branches: above zero, below zero, and the rest. The middle one is the one people leave out."
